    ],
    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 116,
        "text": "So, the city says the new bike lane on Harbor Street cut car traffic by twelve percent. That's their headline.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "980fa0849fcd006e6e003a12c946cbc6d70843383a742d62db452ed73f166678",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 124,
        "sourceEnd": 280,
        "text": "Twelve percent? I read the same report. But that number is only for weekday mornings, between seven and nine. The rest of the day, car numbers barely moved.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2440ea9980104da1431b306d8d6d5f969a45b3726f9cc8dcfa30be9d3708617e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 288,
        "sourceEnd": 386,
        "text": "Right, and the city's press release didn't say that. They just said 'traffic fell twelve percent.'",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "015ae38b04d5ab7a643ef6d7512f94ea71fde08460876fec0655839594ccf397",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 394,
        "sourceEnd": 487,
        "text": "Which is technically true for that window. But it's misleading if you think it means all day.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a590977863ea5e2c59d95033b8dd3062363dbe21cce5e2b87695861071b848ba",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 495,
        "sourceEnd": 598,
        "text": "The bike shop owner, Lena, told me her sales went up thirty percent after the lane opened. She's happy.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0dad1e1a95bca92b0f64123de4b0ca10993ea3e7eea6cf050118a712de19c467",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 606,
        "sourceEnd": 759,
        "text": "I saw that too. But she also said her repair business dropped, because fewer people are bringing in cars. So her total income is actually about the same.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "0e754c322b19c4daea1562634541737e2cbf03ccf45c8c6aee8cb2765da16ea9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 767,
        "sourceEnd": 843,
        "text": "Hmm. So the 'thirty percent' is only for new bike sales, not the whole shop.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "84e2b837945521121906b692ab22e69002bc930abca8d3281d380744a09243ab",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 851,
        "sourceEnd": 994,
        "text": "Exactly. And the delivery company on Fifth Street says their vans now take eight minutes longer on average during rush hour. They're not happy.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "66d4351bf87d959e039fbf5af65e8819cb2fa0880c14d6fce55bffaccdefb638",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1002,
        "sourceEnd": 1198,
        "text": "But the city's traffic engineer, Dr. Patel, says overall journey times across the whole network improved by three percent. She argues that one street's delay is balanced by faster buses elsewhere.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "28a7ab49aaf70ffd1d8c70474f39b8865222f05c6740b496d546a78b845bdf7a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 1206,
        "sourceEnd": 1354,
        "text": "That's a fair point. But the bus company says ridership on the Harbor Street route is up only two percent, not the fifteen percent the city claimed.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "885955de4dcbc12f437bd776496c0bd1b86b6907977b23d4b325326d8958d4f8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1362,
        "sourceEnd": 1390,
        "text": "Where did fifteen come from?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e85ae539694a7c66fecb897bed9dd1ab98a09ce973827845fe12077f45b8d759",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 1398,
        "sourceEnd": 1521,
        "text": "The city counted all bus routes in the district, not just Harbor Street. So the number is real, but it's for a bigger area.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a28666c3e6a54a4e670b7632a72ce321ce9009b2913076ccbbc27100059cdbe3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1529,
        "sourceEnd": 1644,
        "text": "Okay, so we have three accounts: the city's, the businesses', and the transport companies'. They don't fully agree.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "96f2f89bdf95dc92a79e5edac8dbe8053fc5ac18a48602bdd8c2ad97348a4522",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 1652,
        "sourceEnd": 1739,
        "text": "And each one uses a true number to tell a different story. That's the interesting part.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "145dd6e9f0178fc7cd82a1a1644eb6658959fe906b246e0a2d0bc85e13bd8542",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1747,
        "sourceEnd": 1830,
        "text": "What about safety? The city says accidents fell by twenty percent on Harbor Street.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "46c5df01e47ff2ac9593be56b194e86f2dc1eea79d5dcb4064720ff974b202b5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 1838,
        "sourceEnd": 2003,
        "text": "True, but the police data shows most of that drop was in the first month, when the lane was new and drivers were extra careful. Since then, accidents have been flat.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "420f76be4afc85e636bad5f2e8386e6b8e94b8d1e96eb9b4051482e3f8ec7305",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2011,
        "sourceEnd": 2096,
        "text": "So the twenty percent is an average over the whole year, pulled up by one good month.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1988b5e91c33eaeae9cd31a085bdecb64597dffa3ac027a31b8730432200fef2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 2104,
        "sourceEnd": 2259,
        "text": "Yes. And the hospital on King Road says they treated four cyclists in the first month, but only one since. That supports the safety claim, at least partly.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d7a231484b4464314b0a47fe3c1fc4915fba730fac97e5841708f2f3d94864d0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2267,
        "sourceEnd": 2325,
        "text": "So the hospital data is the strongest evidence for safety.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9081856aac25c06c9a19678c9be64f47ca81e5679d1e200881b3f1e6a41332e1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 2333,
        "sourceEnd": 2420,
        "text": "I'd say so. But it's a small number. Four and one. You can't build a big claim on that.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f2c28779ce92ec642a1a92b272b42c330181698d77e40367306412c96c7c59b7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2428,
        "sourceEnd": 2457,
        "text": "Fair. So what's the takeaway?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "dcc951893c1cbd2e3e7e7de30c40cf1e6959fd9afcd5402017da18c517ccc803",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 2465,
        "sourceEnd": 2602,
        "text": "I think the takeaway is: ask 'compared to what, and for how long?' Every number here is real. The argument is about which number matters.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "dee644c9249f7fb4d7fbce676089bd062ef133da8aedb0da8b657afb8015f2c7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2610,
        "sourceEnd": 2747,
        "text": "And who chose the time window. The city chose weekday mornings. The delivery company chose rush hour. The bike shop chose new bike sales.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "974bd22a08e7bdf3ded87f399188887022dcfeb4b3807ca2d3f6fffaefd261e0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 2755,
        "sourceEnd": 2852,
        "text": "Right. Each group picked the window that made its case look best. That's not lying. It's framing.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "30520c6d51771f7677c07dabb05345e6638b4a9e9171086b57d661b18429a49d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2860,
        "sourceEnd": 2937,
        "text": "So for our class project, we should present all three accounts, not just one.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "662d805707c2490c7683c0de02aca93fa8d593f526275c38a524aea6354ad699",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 2945,
        "sourceEnd": 3039,
        "text": "Agreed. And we should show the original data next to each claim, so people can see the window.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a4a9360d62dbd845a0b7ffc2da642dc0538d0bdb888a906319570067151ea3da",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 3047,
        "sourceEnd": 3106,
        "text": "Good. I'll write the city section. You take the businesses.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "6e27ec802059194a676d16a2a4e89264b7d461655fba7440e89ed69bb5abf3ee",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 3114,
        "sourceEnd": 3187,
        "text": "Deal. And let's ask Dr. Patel for the full dataset, not just the summary.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "0e1839e3519981583a3d80fd330deffdb50de07a0c50e3d91bc222d20fb8d95a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 3195,
        "sourceEnd": 3241,
        "text": "Yes. If she says no, we say so in the project.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "44a5b4d74382835890c6d82014ecadb2e1b67c715521fc3b9be8a8a5d60838f8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 3249,
        "sourceEnd": 3272,
        "text": "Perfect. That's honest.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "c329b4117d0b052e868306d5f966a03205cb614e6fa2ecc558f9dfe199d4e441",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
